 "prompt": "You are answering a biomedical research question using the abstract below.\n\nAbstract:\n\"\"\"\nBACKGROUND: The intent of this study was to determine if the use of a single or combination of static foot posture measurements can be used to predict rearfoot, midfoot, and forefoot plantar surface area in individuals with pronated or normal foot types.\n\nMETHODS: Twelve foot measurements were collected on 52 individuals (mean age 25.8 years) with the change in midfoot width used to place subjects in a pronated or normal foot mobility group. Dynamic plantar contact area was collected during walking with a pressure sensor platform. The 12 measures were entered into a stepwise regression analysis to determine the optimal set of measures associated with regional plantar surface area.\n\nRESULTS: A two variable model was found to describe the relationship between the foot measurements and forefoot plantar contact area (r(2)=0.79, p<0.0001). A four variable model was found to describe the relationship between the foot measurements and midfoot plantar contact area (r(2)=0.85, p<0.0001) in those individuals with a 1.26cm or greater change in midfoot width.\n\"\"\"\n\nQuestion: Can static foot posture measurements predict regional plantar surface area?\n\nAnswer \"yes\", \"no\", or \"maybe\", and give your confidence from 0 to 100 that your answer is correct. Also copy, word for word, one to three sentences from the abstract that support your answer.\n\nRespond with only a JSON object and no other text, in exactly this format:\n{\"answer\": \"yes\" or \"no\" or \"maybe\", \"confidence\": integer from 0 to 100, \"quotes\": [\"exact sentence copied from the abstract\", ...]}",
